  m_text: 'Welcome to Agile Lab AR



    1. Move your phone slowly to find a flat surface. A table in good light works best.

    2. Tap the screen to place the 3D lesson.

    3. Use Next and Back to step through.



    Camera: this app uses your camera only to show AR. No photos or personal data are saved. Scores stay on your phone.



    WARNING: Be aware of your surroundings. Do not walk while looking at the screen.'
